'''Pesky Dust''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Nemuina]] from the planet [[Nemunimos IV]].

==Appearance==
Pesky Dust is a short, [[Wikipedia:Fairy|fairy]]-like alien with blue skin. He has purple fairy-like wings, pink spots and blue hair that sticks straight up. Pesky Dust wears a green dress-like outfit with black zigzags, the bottommost one of which is slightly asymmetrical. His hands have three fingers with white gloves on them and his feet have two toes. His eyes are green with feminine eyelines and has pink markings on his cheeks and chin.

Pesky Dust wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
FaFBM (460).png|Sleep Dust Manipulation
FaFBM (477).png|Oneirokinesis
FaFBM (472).png|Dream Observation
MDGS (716).png|Flight
</gallery>
Pesky Dust can release a special kind of dust that makes his victims fall asleep, which works on nearly every known species,{{Refn|[[:File:Gutrot Immune To Pesky Dust.PNG]]|group = DJW|name=gutrot}} including [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapiens]].{{Refn|[[:File:Celestialsapiens Sleeping Dust.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

Under the effects of this dust,{{Refn|[[:File:Nemuina Victims Must Be Dusted.PNG]]|group = DJW}} Pesky Dust can enter, examine, and even manipulate the dreams of any number of beings simultaneously,{{Refn|[[:File:Pesky Dust Multi-Sleep.png]]|group = DJW}} which can be used as a form of interrogation or extracting information from a victim.<ref name="FaFBM">''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref> He can even cause them to have nightmares.<ref name="TMDGS" />

Pesky Dust is capable of flight thanks to his fairy-like wings. He can also leave behind a green trail{{Refn|Alternate versions of Pesky Dust are shown leaving trails in different colors. For example, [[Nighty Knight]]'s trail is colored blue.<ref name="IaMBW1">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]''</ref>|group = note}} while flying.

==Weaknesses==
The effects of Pesky Dust's sleeping dust is temporary. Meaning, even if Pesky Dust were to douse a victim with a large amount of sleeping dust, they would not fall asleep forever, they would have to be continuously exposed to it to stay asleep over an extended period of time.{{Refn|[[:File:Nemuina Eternal Sleep.png]]|group = DJW}}

There are certain beings Pesky Dust is unable to make fall asleep, such as [[Gutrot]]'s [[Gutrot's Species|species]], and his natural predator,{{Refn|group = DJW|name=gutrot}}{{Refn|[[:File:Nemuina Predator Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} who have a small secondary brain cluster which allows it to continue hunting even when the primary brain is asleep.{{Refn|[[:File:Nemuina Predator Powers.png]]|group = DJW}}

Pesky Dust can still be affected by the abilities of other [[Nemuina]]s.{{Refn|[[:File:Nemuina Not Immune To Each Other.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Pesky Dust first appeared in ''[[Outbreak]]'', where he was accidentally unlocked by [[Driba]] and [[Blukic]] when they tried to fix the malfunctioning [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] before they switched him into [[Mole-Stache]].
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Pesky Dust put [[Khyber]] to sleep before entering his dream to find out where [[Albedo]] was taking [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s brain.
*In ''[[The Most Dangerous Game Show]]'', Pesky Dust defeated [[Charles Zenith]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Pesky Dust appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

