==Etymology==
Pesky Dust's name is a play on the words "pesky" and "pixie dust". 

==Trivia==
*The design for Pesky Dust came from [[Lillimusha DiForestini]], drawn by [[Steven Choi]] or [[Chap Yaep]]. Meanwhile, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with his name.{{Refn|[[:File:Steven and Chap Came Up With Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Pesky Dust's appearance is similar to that of [[Wikipedia:Tinker Bell|Tinker Bell]]'s from ''[[Wikipedia:Peter Pan|Peter Pan]]''.
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] compared Pesky Dust's powers to those of [[bulbapedia:Jigglypuff (Pokémon)|Jigglypuff]] from Pokémon, notable for putting foes to sleep with the move Sing.{{Refn|[[:File:Pesky Dust Powers Inspired by Jigglypuff.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Pesky Dust is one of four aliens unlocked by [[Driba]] and [[Blukic]]; the other three being [[Walkatrout]], [[Mole-Stache]], and [[The Worst]].<ref name="Outbreak">''[[Outbreak]]''</ref>
*In his first appearance, Pesky Dust shared the same voice as Ben due to the Omnitrix malfunctioning. The out-of-universe reason was because the crew originally did not envision him as a usable alien for later episodes.{{Refn|[[:File:Outbreak Alien Voices Explaination.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Pesky Dust's voice was eventually changed to a high-pitched, trilling, feminine voice in ''For a Few Brains More'' because the crew liked how he turned out.{{Refn|[[:File:Outbreak Alien Voices Changed.png]]|group = DJW}}
**As such, he is the only transformation besides [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]] to share the same voice actors as both versions of Ben Prime.
*[[Khyber]] is afraid of Nemuinas like Pesky Dust<ref name="FaFBM" /> and considers the dream he was entrapped in during ''For a Few Brains More'' to be his worst nightmare.{{Refn|[[:File:Khyber's Worst Nightmare.png]]|group = DJW}}
**While [[Kai Green|Kai]] thinks Pesky Dust is cute, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] considers his Pesky Dust dangerous and considers "nobody to mess with".<ref name="TMDGS" />
**Ben prefers Pesky Dust to Mole-Stache.<ref name="IaMBW1"/>
*Similar to [[Astrodactyl]], Pesky Dust makes a sound when he talks. This sound is like a trill, chirp, whistle, or purr.
*[[Albedo]] is unable to transform into Pesky Dust.{{Refn|[[:File:Albedo Does Not Have Outbreak Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Despite this, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] drew some art of Negative Pesky Dust in 2020, which can be found in the [[Pesky Dust/Gallery|gallery]].{{Refn|[[:File:Negative Pesky Dust Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}

